    "fr": "OSINT",
    "en": "OSINT"
   },
   "description": {
    "fr": "Reconnaissance passive d'une cible autorisée : Google Dorks, Shodan, certificats (crt.sh), Wayback Machine et un inventaire « Actifs découverts » (DNS, RDAP, ASN, ports connus).",
    "en": "Passive reconnaissance of an authorised target: Google Dorks, Shodan, certificates (crt.sh), Wayback Machine and a \"Discovered assets\" inventory (DNS, RDAP, ASN, known ports)."
